  "bio": "Renan Martins is a highly skilled, award-winning tattoo artist based in Atibaia, Brazil. Specializing in black & gray, realism, and floral styles, Martins has been perfecting his craft since 2004. His professionalism is clear in every precise stroke and detailed design he creates, ensuring his clients walk away feeling happy and proud of their new art.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Atibaia, Sao Paulo, Brazil",
